name phfparen
category Package
revision 41859
shortdesc Parenthetic math expressions made simpler and less redundant
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a more condensed and flexible syntax for
longdesc parenthesis-delimited expressions in math mode which also
longdesc allows for an easier switching of brace sizes. For example, the
longdesc syntax " `\big( a + b ) " can be used to replace "\bigl( a + b
longdesc \bigr)".
